WEBVTT

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.990
Poco!

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.510
Don't go too far on your own!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.820
Souta!

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:36.680
<b>Poco's Udon World</b>

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:03.220
Episode 8: "Shodoshima"

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:02.160
Yes. We're on the ferry now.

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.140
We should be at Shodoshima in about an hour.

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:06.700
All right.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:10.150
I already told their president, 
Manabu, about you.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.340
Thank you.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:16.830
Wow, it's been so long since I last went 
to Shodoshima. I'm a little excited!

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.240
Poco!

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:20.910
Is the kid doing well?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.270
He's as restless as ever.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.410
That reminds me...

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:28.260
Hiroshi took some time off 
and is heading your way, too.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:29.060
What?!

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:32.390
He overheard that you were going to Shodoshima.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:34.080
So he's biking there.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:34.920
Biking?!

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:40.930
<b>Gaogao-chan and</b>

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.930
<b>The Blue Sky</b>

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:44.800
Poco.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.160
<i>Gaogao-chan, lunch is ready!</i>

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.050
Souta!

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:48.780
Gaogao-chan! Gaogao-chan!

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.410
<i>Huh? Huh?</i>

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.690
You really like that show, don't you?

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:50.870
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:57.570
<b>I went out to play.
I'll be back by dinner.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.100
<i>"I went out to play.</i>

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:57.570
<i>I'll be back by dinner. From Gaogao."</i>

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.210
<i>Gaogao-chan left on a journey in secret.</i>

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.060
<i>Gaogao-chan wanted to...</i>

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:07.120
Gaogao-chan!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.330
Ah...

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:15.090
No! Wanna watch Gaogao-chan!

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.130
Sorry!

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:15.090
So sorry!

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.560
Poco, I know you love Gaogao-chan,

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.380
but it's your first time on a ferry.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.090
Gaogao-chan...

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:36.910
Wow! The Red Lighthouse is 
already so far in the distance...

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.350
Do you remember it? 
That's where we caught an octopus.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.610
The octopus went "pyooo"!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.420
Right, I remember. 
You were all covered in black.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:48.870
Souta!

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:50.560
Those koi?

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:52.550
Those are jellyfish.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:56.560
The sea breeze is strong!

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.100
But doesn't it feel great?

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.510
Look, you can see it now!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:04.770
Shodoshima!

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:15.160
Let's see, to get to the office...

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.120
Looks like it's not that far.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:19.730
Why don't we walk there?

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:21.260
Walk, walk!

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.030
"Team Planet"...

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:36.690
This must be it.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.740
Hello?

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:42.340
Hewwo?

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.290
Looks like nobody's in...

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.890
<b>Shodoshima</b>

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.890
<b>Treasure Island Project</b>

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:06.700
Souta!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:12.410
Well, what an adorable visitor!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:14.750
I'm sorry! We let ourselves in...

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:15.970
Souta!

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:20.360
Oh... Would you be the developer 
Dahama-kun mentioned?

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:21.380
Yes.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.450
I'm Tawara Souta.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.880
Nice to meet you. I'm Saeki.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.530
I'm sorry. We knew you were coming,

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.510
but the boss just stepped out a moment ago.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:36.390
It's all right. We'll find something to do.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.110
Is this your first time on Shodoshima?

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.920
I have relatives living here, 
so I've been here a few times.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.400
But it's Poco's first time.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.530
Poco?

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:48.080
Yes. He's Poco.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.320
That's a cute nickname.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:51.600
<i>It's his actual name.</i>

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:56.600
Poco-chan, since it's your 
first time on Shodoshima,

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:58.370
why don't you check out Angel Road?

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.880
Ge... Gel?

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:03.510
Lucky for you, the tide's out right now.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.530
Poco!

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:09.260
Don't go too far on your own!

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:11.510
Souta!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.370
This is incredible.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.640
Hard to believe you can walk 
all the way to the other island...

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.330
<i>When I first met him,</i>

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:28.090
<i>I wondered if I was dreaming.</i>

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.960
<i>I still think that, sometimes.</i>

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:35.220
<i>That this life we have is like a dream.</i>

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:38.660
<i>How long will I be</i>

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.080
Wait for me!

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.320
<i>able to stay with Poco?</i>

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.390
Poco!

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:47.550
Souta!

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:50.410
Jeez. Your ears and tails are out, you know!

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:53.180
I make them go bye-bye.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:02.690
I'm here,

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.940
Shodoshima!

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:08.030
I wonder if Souta-san is here yet...

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:16.040
Nice catch!

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:17.370
Don'tcha think?

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:20.390
Nice catch! Don'tcha think?

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:22.290
Nice catch! Don'tcha think?

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.540
Nice catch! Don'tcha think?

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.030
I think you caught my heart!

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.890
<b>Art Festival</b>

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.890
<b>in Shodoshima</b>

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:49.490
Gaogao-chan!

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:51.320
Gaogao-chan?

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:54.200
Gaogao-chan?

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:56.950
Gaogao-chan?

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:00.950
Gaogao—

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:15.390
I am Gaogao-chan...

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:20.720
Yah, cold!

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:22.770
That was close...

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.420
The tide's coming in.

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:27.260
When did I doze off—

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:28.700
Huh?

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:31.860
Poco?

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.910
<b>Tonosho Harbor Terminal</b>

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.150
Hiroshi-kun?

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:41.550
Sorry I'm late coming to get you—

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.870
C/C++, C#,

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:45.800
Um... You are Hiroshi-kun, right?

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.160
Lua, Scala, Java...

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.790
<b>Mumble           Mumble</b>

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:47.200
C/C++, C#,

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.550
<b>Mumble       Mumble</b>

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:48.470
Lua, Scala, Java...

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:51.220
I'm a genius programmer. I'm a genius programmer.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:54.050
<b>Mumble Mumble</b>

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:52.330
What's wrong with that guy?

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:52.610
There's no language I don't know...

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.050
He's scary...

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.050
There's no language I don't know...

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:57.350
So what's with this stupid code?!

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:59.490
Sorry, I can't understand what you're saying.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:02.510
Huh? What?

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:05.360
"I met a beautiful woman at the harbor"?

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.190
"Apparently, she's a Kagawa local."

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:10.950
"I might never run into her again,

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.210
but I couldn't ask for her number"?

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.200
And the rest is garbled text.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:19.370
<b>Mumble                     Mumble</b>

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:16.430
I want to disappear...

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:19.010
To sink to the bottom of the electronic sea...

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:19.940
<i>Oh, great.</i>

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.450
<b>Mumble                                                       Mumble</b>

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:22.450
<i>Genius men are a huge pain in the butt!</i>

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:24.710
Huh?

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.040
Souta-kun?

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:26.940
Excuse me...

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.810
Have you seen Poco?

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:31.960
What is it? Is everything okay?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:34.050
P-Poco, he...

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:36.580
I only took my eyes off him for a second,

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.090
and he disappeared!

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:39.350
What?!

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:41.180
As small as he is,

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:44.010
I don't think he could have gone far.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:45.840
The island is still pretty big.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:47.300
Let's split up and look for him.

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:48.350
Got it!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.730
I'll circle around this area!

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:53.850
I'll go search the west side of the island.

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:55.720
If I find anything, I'll call you!

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:01.130
Poco... Where did you go?

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.280
Poco!

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.600
Poco?

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.650
<i>What if someone saw his ears and tail?</i>

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:42.160
<i>What if he was in his tanuki form 
and someone caught him?</i>

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:45.330
<i>What if he's scared?</i>

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:48.340
Ow!

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:55.800
Poco?

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:58.300
Poco!

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.330
Thank God.

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:02.740
Jeez, you scared me—

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:03.300
Poco?

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:05.670
Wait! Where are you going?

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:07.220
Why are you running away?

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.210
Poco! Wait!

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:11.610
<i>I've been trying not to think about it.</i>

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.630
<i>What is he?</i>

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:16.070
<i>Why did he come into my life?</i>

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:19.410
I brought that gelatin you like!

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:20.700
Let's go home together!

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:23.470
<i>Will we be able to stay together?</i>

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.040
Poco! Wait!

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:28.930
Don't!

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:31.950
Don't run that way!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:40.590
Souta?

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.180
Souta.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.050
Souta!

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:46.350
What the heck are you thinkin'?!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.100
Sis?

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:52.910
Whew! Good thing this old man's 
driving skills were on the ball!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.050
I was worried when ya suddenly 
said you were quittin',

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:57.610
so I went to the house, but nobody was home!

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:59.200
What are you doing here?

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.590
The old lady next door told me where ya were.

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:03.790
More importantly, that critter...

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.240
Poco?!

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:14.700
Honestly, what's goin' on? 
Is everything okay?

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:15.880
Sis...

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:17.940
Poco's missing!

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:20.480
It's... It's my fault!

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:22.380
I shouldn't have taken my eyes off of him!

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.250
What do I do?

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.830
What if Poco's hurt?

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.970
What if he drowned in the ocean?

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:34.270
Get it together!

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:37.470
Ya can't be wishy-washy at a time like this!

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:40.710
You're the only one Poco-chan 
can count on, aren't ya?

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:43.080
Ya gotta keep it together for him!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.280
You love him, don't ya?

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:52.390
At first...

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:55.490
I didn't take it that seriously. 
Like I was keeping a pet.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:56.790
But...

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.330
It took a lot more effort than I thought.

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:02.120
It was exhausting...

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:04.080
and fun...

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:06.800
and it made me happy.

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:11.680
I want...

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:14.890
I want to be with Poco.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:17.960
Please...

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:20.570
Please help me find Poco.

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:23.980
Don't you worry!

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:26.320
If we all look for him, 
we're sure to find him!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.410
What is it?

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:34.840
Just now...

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:36.220
I heard his voice...

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:37.130
Huh?

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:38.960
H-Hey! Souta?

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:45.580
Hey, did ya really hear him?

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.100
Souta, wait!

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:56.350
Poco!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.730
Souta!

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:01.980
Poco?

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:05.390
Souta!

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.800
Souta!

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:09.990
Poco!

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:16.770
Souta!

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:19.380
And here we are.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.050
Souta!

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:25.820
Souta, boat! Lotsa fish!

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:25.520
Poco...

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:27.460
Yummy, yummy fish!

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:28.260
Poco!

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.350
You know you shouldn't go off with strangers.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:35.100
I told you not to go too far on your own!

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:42.510
If someone took you away from me,

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.500
I'd be very sad.

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.350
I'd be worried sick.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:51.120
So don't go anywhere with 
a stranger ever again, okay?

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.290
Do you understand?

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:56.410
Sowwy.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.280
Thank God.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:04.200
Thank God you're safe.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:07.870
Thank goodness.

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:11.540
I had no idea this had become such a big fuss...

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.390
Um... Who are you?

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.430
Souta-kun!

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.570
You found Poco-chan?

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:19.580
Boss?!

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.350
Where have you been?!

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.690
Souta-kun and this child had an 
awful time because you were gone!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:26.230
Wait...

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.800
Don't tell me...

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:30.190
Actually...

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:35.160
Got a bite!

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:37.160
Gaogao-chan!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.160
Huh?!

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:41.530
What?!

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:47.550
I was going to come straight back, but the 
fishing was better than I expected...

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.970
The fishing?! Who cares about the fishing?!

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:52.330
What are you thinking?!

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:53.510
Sorry, sorry...

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:59.580
I really am very sorry for being so careless.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:00.890
Oh... It's okay.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:03.880
I should introduce myself.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:07.880
I'm the president of Team Planet, Saeki Manabu.

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.600
I'm his wife, Yukie.

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:11.280
I'm so sorry for the trouble he caused.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.050
Oh, no...

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:13.980
Ah, excuse me.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:15.910
Hiroshi?

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.410
I forgot about him!

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:19.020
Souta-san!

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:21.410
I can't find the little guy!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:25.260
What do we do? This island is just too big!

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:27.210
Huh? What?

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:28.720
Huh?

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:30.700
You already found him?

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:33.930
What the heck?!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.910
How could you guys not tell me?

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:39.210
I climbed all the way up here to look for him...

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.850
<b>Whisper 
Whisper</b>

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.870
Yikes. What's with him?

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.060
<b>Hiss</b>

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:42.400
What is with this place, anyway?

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:44.190
Why are there so many couples?!

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:44.060
<b>Hiss</b>

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:44.960
<b>I love you</b>

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.270
<b>Together forever</b>

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.730
<b>We're getting married</b>

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:46.060
<b>Risa & Takashi LOVE</b>

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.780
"Lovers' Sanctuary"? Give me a break!

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.420
<b>Lovers' Sanctuary</b>

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:49.660
"If you hold hands in the middle of Angel Road,

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:51.600
you'll be together forever"?! Yeah, right!

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:55.450
As if something so superstitious 
could ever be real!

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:56.960
It could never...

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:02.810
<i>It's her!</i>

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:06.900
Whoa! The wind's fierce—

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:19.120
A-Are you okay?

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:22.020
Thanks...

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:22.930
Huh?

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:25.850
Aren't you the guy I saw at the harbor?

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.820
You're soakin' wet!

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:30.630
You can use this.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.360
Uh... Er...

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:36.360
<i>It's no use. The words aren't coming out!</i>

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:38.870
<i>And after I finally found her...</i>

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.820
<i>What do I do in a situation like this?</i>

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.120
<i>Help me, God! Buddha!</i>

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:46.210
<i>Dahama-sama!</i>

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.750
The three rules of communication:

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.130
Say a proper hello!

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:51.880
Make eye contact!

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.510
And... smile!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.690
If you can do those things, you'll be fine.

00:17:58.050 --> 00:17:58.890
<i>Okay!</i>

00:17:59.080 --> 00:17:59.940
Um...

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:01.890
My name's Hiroshi!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.020
I'm Ooishi Rinko.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.320
R-Rinko-san...

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:09.100
Huh? What's this, Hiroshi?

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:10.520
You've met my sister?

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:12.000
Your sister?!

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:15.110
Rinko-san is your sister?!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.280
Uh, yeah.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:19.420
<i>Souta-san would become my brother-in-law?</i>

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:21.030
<i>I wouldn't mind that...</i>

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:22.990
Wait... "Ooishi"?

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:26.040
You have different last names?

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.280
Well, yeah. She's married.

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:33.130
<i>A married woman...</i>

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:37.040
Hii-kun?

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:38.510
Um...

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.110
Hiroshi-kun?

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:45.270
Hii-kun!

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:49.650
Maybe we should give him some time alone.

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:52.460
Uh... Yeah.

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:57.830
Please keep your hijinks under control.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.530
Sorry, really.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:01.660
Poco?

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.250
I'm not mad anymore.

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:11.490
Come on.

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:13.000
Come over here.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:18.600
Souta!

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.430
So lovey-dovey.

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.190
A far cry from us...

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:25.810
Ow, ow, ow!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.880
Souta! Carry me! Carry me!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.050
Sure, sure.

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:09.990
<b>Gaogao-chan and</b>

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:09.990
<b>The Blue Sky</b>

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:16.000
<b>Episode 8: 
"Gaogao-chan and the World Above the Clouds"</b>

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:12.330
<i>The Tale of GaoGao-chan</i>

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:15.200
<i>and the World Above the Clouds!</i>

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:25.970
<i>Gao?</i>

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.460
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:29.540
<i>You're awake, are you?</i>

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:33.880
<i>Welcome to the entrance 
to the world above the clouds.</i>

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:35.020
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:38.290
<i>My name is Bunama Kiesa.</i>

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:41.040
<i>I'm this world's Creative Director.</i>

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:43.570
<i>Basically, I'm your Creator.</i>

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:46.320
<i>Creative... D...</i>

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:50.300
<i>It's a pity what happened to you.</i>

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:54.100
<i>I see... So I'm...</i>

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:56.970
<i>Not getting any bites today...</i>

00:21:56.970 --> 00:21:58.210
<i>I give up.</i>

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:01.100
<i>Shall we be on our way, then?</i>

00:22:05.740 --> 00:22:07.220
<i>Something wrong?</i>

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.620
<i>I don't want to go yet, gao.</i>

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:13.560
<i>They'll all be sad, gao!</i>

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:17.160
<i>Okay.</i>

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:17.600
<i>What?</i>

00:22:18.010 --> 00:22:21.170
<i>I'm the Creative Director, after all.</i>

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:23.150
<i>I can do anything!</i>

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:27.230
<i>And so, Gaogao-chan</i>

00:22:27.230 --> 00:22:30.330
<i>returned to Mimi and Momo's place.</i>

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>I'm back, gao!</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>Gao?</i>

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:36.000
<b>Vacation</b>

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:36.000
<b>Woo-hoo!</b>

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:36.000
<b>It's here! It's here!</b>

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:41.000
